  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #091212;
      --foreground: #FCFAF7;
      --accent: #E8674A;
      --card: #11201D;
      --border: #182B27;
      --muted: #162925;
      --muted-foreground: #8FA7A7;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background-color: var(--background);
      color: var(--foreground);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 48rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--foreground);
    }
    p {
      color: var(--muted-foreground);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .privacy-box {
      background: rgba(232, 103, 74, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(232, 103, 74, 0.25);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .lang-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .lang-link {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--foreground);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .lang-link:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    ul {
      margin-left: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted-foreground);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main id="main-content" class="container">
    <header role="banner" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
      <a href="/en/" class="logo site-logo" rel="home" aria-label="Real BMI Homepage" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;text-decoration:none;">
        <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="Real BMI Logo" width="32" height="32" style="border-radius:0.5rem;background:var(--accent);padding:0.25rem;object-fit:contain;" />
        <span class="site-title" style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--foreground);">Real BMI</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/" style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;">← Return to Home</a>
    </header>
    <article>
      <h1>Privacy Policy & Data Governance</h1>
      <p>
        At <strong>Real BMI</strong>, user privacy and biometric data security are foundational architecture requirements. This policy explains how information is handled when you visit our website, compute anthropometric metrics, or interact with our interactive WebGL 3D body visualizer tools.
      </p>

      <div class="privacy-box">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">Architectural Privacy Guarantee:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.95rem;">
          <li>Zero server-side biometric storage: height, weight, age, and circumferences execute locally in your browser.</li>
          <li>Google Consent Mode v2: tracking cookies remain strictly disabled until you provide affirmative consent.</li>
          <li>Local browser preferences: settings (dark mode, metric/imperial units) persist only on your device.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>Summary of Information Practices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Client-Side Local Computation:</strong> Every calculation (including BMI, BMR, TDEE, Body Fat, and 3D avatar morphing) runs on your local device JavaScript engine. No biometric values are sent over network requests or logged into external databases.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Consent Mode v2 & Analytics:</strong> We implement Google Consent Mode v2 with default denied states for advertising and analytics cookies. Only when you consent through our cookie preferences banner do services like Google Analytics 4 (anonymized telemetry) activate.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Disclosures:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;">aboutads.info</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Your International Privacy Rights:</strong> Under GDPR (EU/UK) and CCPA/CPRA (California), you maintain the right to inspect, revoke consent, or opt out of non-essential tracking at any time via our Cookie Policy controls.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Select Your Language Version</h2>
      <p>Read the comprehensive Privacy Policy in your preferred language:</p>
      <div class="lang-grid">
        <a href="/en/privacy-policy/" class="lang-link">🇺🇸 English (EN)</a>
        <a href="/es/privacy-policy/" class="lang-link">🇪🇸 Español (ES)</a>
